<title>BRAZIL: Bovespa to extend trading hours today to 2030 GMT.</title>
<headline>Bovespa to extend trading hours today to 2030 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sao Paulo Stock Exchange (Bovespa) said it was extending today's trading session to 1730 local time/1630 EDT/2030 GMT due to technical problems that delayed the updating of its ticker for over an hour.</p>
<p>The trading session normally runs from 1000 local time/0900 EDT/1300 GMT to 1700 local time/1600 EDT/2000 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
